  "bodyHash": "68eddedb61e35f92",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UWsTm2svK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"394\" height=\"115\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">全新 Discord 服务器！用于私人支持和更新提醒。</span></h1>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/328/mod-info.png\" alt=\"mod info\" width=\"1024\" height=\"107\"></h2>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">您只需要该模组的维度吗？请下载：</span> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pharaohs-legacy-demension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">别忘了在我的个人资料中查看我的其他模组！</span></h1>\n<h2>欢迎使用本模组（法老的遗产）</h2>\n<h2>本模组基于古埃及时代 / 法老统治时期。</h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>公元前</strong>&nbsp;<strong>3100年</strong></span></h2>\n<h2>本模组为你的 Minecraft 服务器添加了一片巨大的沙漠。让人沉迷于过去的辉煌岁月！</h2>\n<h1>想要制作传送门吗？请查看媒体标签页。</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/900/235/portal.png\" alt=\"portal\" width=\"1899\" height=\"958\"></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">要激活传送门，请制作（撒哈拉图腾）&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/900/493/minecraft-forge_-1.png\" alt=\"Portal key\" width=\"1012\" height=\"277\"></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意！下载此模组前请备份您的 Minecraft 服务器。我们不希望您的服务器因大型生物群系模组而损坏。</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">请注意：如果您遇到任何崩溃或错误，请在 GitHub (Issues) 上报告。</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意！使用多个生物群系模组可能会导致本模组被屏蔽。</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">我们仅支持 ( 1.20.1 及更高版本 )，不再进行降级适配。</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"line 3\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/330/biome.png\" alt=\"Sounds\" width=\"1024\" height=\"85\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>谁不喜欢宁静的生物群系背景音呢？我们为生物群系添加了真实的声音。让风穿过你的耳朵 / 聆听鸟鸣。</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"Line 4\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/331/skywater.png\" alt=\"Sounds &amp; water\" width=\"1024\" height=\"93\"></p>\n<h2>水和天空的颜色将匹配真实埃及的色彩！</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"line 5\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/335/structure.png\" alt=\"structures\" width=\"1024\" height=\"149\"></p>\n<h2>我们在生物群系中添加了几座建筑。神庙、狮身人面像、小金字塔等！请参阅照片以获取更清晰的视图。</h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/647/minecraft_neoforge__1-21-4_-_singleplayer_15-2.png\" alt=\"Main structure\" width=\"1837\" height=\"1282\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/644/minecraft_neoforge__1-21-4_-_singleplayer_15-2.png\" alt=\"Temple\" width=\"2158\" height=\"1091\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/643/minecraft_neoforge__1-21-4_-_singleplayer_15-2.png\" alt=\"Lione\" width=\"2054\" height=\"1148\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">几种 Minecraft 结构会在此生物群系中生成。林地府邸、金字塔、村庄等。</span></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"Line\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/324/kagud6s.png\" alt=\"curseforge\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/322/90zvx3m.png\" alt=\"neoforge\" width=\"278\" height=\"278\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/323/636829723898798601.png\" alt=\"fabric\" width=\"239\" height=\"239\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/329/szhld8n.jpg\" alt=\"Run away!\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">本模组使用 IntelliJ 创建：</span></h1>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/904/291/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"Intell\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"></p>",
